참조: [Data Visualization with ggplot2::Cheat Sheet "Faceting"](https://rstudio.github.io/cheatsheets/html/data-visualization.html#faceting)

#### 개요

하나 이상의 이산 변수값을 기준으로 그래프를 여러 개로 나누어 표시


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
library(ggplot2)
t <- ggplot(mpg, aes(cty, hwy)) + geom_point()
```
:::



#### 형태

##### 열로 배치


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
t + facet_grid(. ~ fl)
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-faceting_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-2-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


##### 행으로 배치


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
t + facet_grid(year ~ .)
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-faceting_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-3-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


##### 행, 열로 배치


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
t + facet_grid(year ~ fl)
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-faceting_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-4-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


##### 사각형 안으로 넣기


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
t + facet_wrap(~ fl)
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-faceting_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-5-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::



#### 보조 그래프별로 축의 범위를 다르게 설정

- `scales` 속성을 "free", "free_x", "free_y"로 설정


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
t + facet_grid(drv ~ fl, scales = "free")
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-faceting_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-6-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


#### 서브 그래프 라벨


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
t + facet_grid(. ~ fl, labeller = label_both)
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-faceting_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-7-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
t + facet_grid(fl ~ ., labeller = label_bquote(alpha ^ .(fl)))
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-faceting_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-8-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::
